# 仮身一覧 given a record that is a text (design 11.3), for tools/ui_run.py. 仮身一覧 (a process)
# opens nothing but a figure, so the desktop gives a text to the program of texts instead
# (prog_for_kind). A copy of 基本文章編集 (mkbig doc 5) whose applist says 仮身一覧 (apps) is
# opened: the text editor's process opens it, not 仮身一覧's, which would say it cannot open it.
mkbig doc 5
apps big virtual-object-list
logmark
open big
expectsincein 60 document: opened 基本文章編集 paragraphs 5
wait 800
move 690 490
wait 500
shot cabdoc_p
key 08 01
expect document: closed
absent cabinet: the object cannot be read
